{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# KNKT Railway Risk Analysis — EDA\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook untuk eksplorasi satu cuplikan telemetri. Nama proyek ini bukan klaim afiliasi resmi KNKT. Data adalah transkripsi screenshot dan belum tervalidasi terhadap log sumber. Jangan gunakan hasil untuk keputusan operasional/keselamatan.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Persiapan dan pemuatan data\n",
    "Jalankan notebook dari root repository. Nilai `--` dikonversi menjadi missing, bukan nol. Data mentah tidak diubah."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "ROOT = Path.cwd()\n",
    "DATA_PATH = ROOT / 'data' / 'raw' / 'telemetri.csv'\n",
    "OUT_DIR = ROOT / 'data' / 'processed'\n",
    "IMG_DIR = ROOT / 'images'\n",
    "OUT_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "IMG_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "if not DATA_PATH.exists():\n",
    "    raise FileNotFoundError(f'Tidak menemukan {DATA_PATH}. Jalankan dari root repository.')\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv(DATA_PATH, na_values=['--', ''])\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Struktur dan kualitas data\n",
    "Timestamp dibentuk dari tanggal dan waktu. Pemeriksaan duplikat timestamp hanya indikasi; bila data menggabungkan beberapa perjalanan, perlu identitas perjalanan sebelum menilai duplikasi."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('Dimensi:', df.shape)\n",
    "display(df.dtypes.to_frame('dtype'))\n",
    "df['timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(df['date'] + ' ' + df['time'], dayfirst=True, errors='coerce')\n",
    "numeric_cols = ['km', 'm', 'speed_kmh', 'acceleration_m_s2', 'load_amps', 'eab_bp_psi', 'eab_bc_psi']\n",
    "for col in numeric_cols:\n",
    "    df[col] = pd.to_numeric(df[col], errors='coerce')\n",
    "print('Rentang timestamp:', df['timestamp'].min(), '—', df['timestamp'].max())\n",
    "print('Timestamp duplikat:', df['timestamp'].duplicated().sum())\n",
    "display(df.isna().sum().rename('missing_count').to_frame().assign(missing_pct=lambda x: 100*x['missing_count']/len(df)))\n",
    "display(df.describe(include='all').T)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Missing values dan statistik numerik\n",
    "Kolom akselerasi memiliki nilai yang tidak tercatat pada cuplikan akhir. Tidak dilakukan imputasi karena imputasi dapat mengubah interpretasi sinyal."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "missing = df.isna().sum().sort_values(ascending=False)\n",
    "missing = missing[missing > 0]\n",
    "if not missing.empty:\n",
    "    ax = missing.plot(kind='bar', figsize=(8, 4), color='#d97706', title='Jumlah missing value per kolom')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('Jumlah baris'); ax.set_xlabel('Kolom'); plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "    plt.savefig(IMG_DIR / 'missing_values.png', dpi=150); plt.show()\n",
    "display(df[numeric_cols].describe().T)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Distribusi, boxplot, korelasi, dan deret waktu\n",
    "Korelasi menunjukkan asosiasi dalam sampel ini, bukan kausalitas. Baris yang berurutan per detik juga tidak independen."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plot_cols = ['speed_kmh', 'acceleration_m_s2', 'load_amps', 'eab_bp_psi', 'eab_bc_psi']\n",
    "for col in plot_cols:\n",
    "    vals = df[col].dropna()\n",
    "    if vals.empty: continue\n",
    "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 4))\n",
    "    sns.histplot(vals, kde=(vals.nunique() > 2), ax=ax, color='#2563eb')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f'Distribusi {col}'); fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "    fig.savefig(IMG_DIR / f'histogram_{col}.png', dpi=150); plt.show()\n",
    "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 2.5))\n",
    "    sns.boxplot(x=vals, ax=ax, color='#93c5fd'); ax.set_title(f'Boxplot {col}')\n",
    "    fig.tight_layout(); fig.savefig(IMG_DIR / f'boxplot_{col}.png', dpi=150); plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "corr = df[numeric_cols].corr(method='spearman', min_periods=3)\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(9, 7))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(corr, annot=True, fmt='.2f', cmap='vlag', center=0, ax=ax)\n",
    "ax.set_title('Korelasi Spearman — fitur numerik'); fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "fig.savefig(IMG_DIR / 'heatmap.png', dpi=150); plt.show()\n",
    "corr.to_csv(OUT_DIR / 'correlation_spearman.csv')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(df['timestamp'], df['speed_kmh'], marker='.', label='Kecepatan (km/jam)')\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('Waktu'); ax.set_ylabel('Kecepatan (km/jam)'); ax.grid(True, alpha=.3)\n",
    "ax.set_title('Kecepatan terhadap waktu'); fig.autofmt_xdate(); fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "fig.savefig(IMG_DIR / 'speed_time_series.png', dpi=150); plt.show()\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(df['timestamp'], df['eab_bp_psi'], marker='.', label='EAB BP (psi)')\n",
    "ax.plot(df['timestamp'], df['eab_bc_psi'], marker='.', label='EAB BC (psi)')\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('Waktu'); ax.set_ylabel('Tekanan (psi)'); ax.legend(); ax.grid(True, alpha=.3)\n",
    "ax.set_title('Tekanan EAB terhadap waktu'); fig.autofmt_xdate(); fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "fig.savefig(IMG_DIR / 'brake_pressure_time_series.png', dpi=150); plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Kandidat outlier (IQR)\n",
    "IQR hanya menandai kandidat statistik. Nilai ekstrem tidak otomatis salah dan tidak dihapus. Periksa konteks sensor dan dokumentasi sistem sebelum memutuskan perlakuan."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "outlier_rows = []\n",
    "for col in numeric_cols:\n",
    "    s = df[col].dropna()\n",
    "    if s.empty: continue\n",
    "    q1, q3 = s.quantile([.25, .75]); iqr = q3 - q1\n",
    "    low, high = q1 - 1.5*iqr, q3 + 1.5*iqr\n",
    "    mask = df[col].notna() & ((df[col] < low) | (df[col] > high))\n",
    "    for idx in df.index[mask]:\n",
    "        outlier_rows.append({'row': int(idx), 'timestamp': df.loc[idx, 'timestamp'], 'column': col, 'value': df.loc[idx, col], 'lower': low, 'upper': high})\n",
    "outliers = pd.DataFrame(outlier_rows)\n",
    "display(outliers)\n",
    "outliers.to_csv(OUT_DIR / 'iqr_outlier_candidates.csv', index=False)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Simpan hasil olahan dan batasan\n",
    "Hasil olahan mempertahankan missing value. Validasi data sumber, arti singkatan, satuan, dan definisi jarak (`km`/`m`) diperlukan sebelum menyusun kesimpulan substantif. Satu cuplikan pendek tidak cukup untuk mengukur risiko atau menyatakan operasi normal/tidak normal."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.to_csv(OUT_DIR / 'telemetri_parsed.csv', index=False)\n",
    "print(f'Data olahan: {OUT_DIR / \'telemetri_parsed.csv\'}')\n",
    "print(f'Grafik tersimpan di: {IMG_DIR.resolve()}')"
   ]
  }
 ],
